OL,3,ANursery fined after baby boy burned by
OL,4,Ableach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nursery has been fined after a
OL,7,F10-month-old boy was badly burned by a
OL,8,Fbucket of boiled water containing
OL,9,Fbleach.
OL,11,FThe child - who cannot be named for
OL,12,Flegal reasons - was injured at Little
OL,13,FDreams Nursery in Aberdeen in November
OL,14,F2021.
OL,16,FThe nursery admitted breaching health
OL,17,Fand safety regulations at Aberdeen
OL,18,FSheriff Court.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
